{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"OPERATIONAL LESSONS (both self-inflicted): (1) editing a ticket's description WHILE its own review-plan run is in flight cancels that run with 'cancelled-stale' and signs nothing - 111a lost a full review this way; settle the plan, THEN review. (2) Running 7 concurrent review-plan processes against one tracker produced a 'store-read-failure' on a4d7 - reduce concurrency to ~4. Also: leaf 1 (6f18) LANDED as gerrit 55e308eaaf via change 2046 (LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, submitted). Follow-up change 2048 pushed to satisfy 6f18 AC2 (the guard proved it PASSES but never that it FLAGS): extracted paths._offending_line, unit-tested flagging/suppression/reason-less-marker directly, and the tree scan now shares that one classifier instead of re-implementing the match."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787365788329371001,"uuid":"febf442f-7cae-4445-b192-a9e00b934a86"}